BEGIN_DESC
TANTRA BETA 2 - Mars, Valles Marineris: in the commander's seat. Lift-off on planetary engines, anamezon far out.
Niza Krit sits in the commander's seat of the bridge capsule. The person keeps the focus: everything is done from the seat with the mouse and the numpad.
INSIDE: F stand up / sit down at a seat (not in the suit); W/S/A/D/Q/E walk, Shift run, right mouse held turns the body with the look. Left click: screens and buttons within reach. V (in the commander's seat): outside view of the ship, V again back.
BRIDGE: front screen tabs FLIGHT / ENGINES / PARAMETERS; side screens carry six Orbiter MFDs; left screen MECHANISMS (+ thermal), right screen POWER PLANT.
1. Stand up: MECHANISMS - LAUNCH position (raises the ship onto the stern legs, ~2 min; the pods help). STOP / EMERGENCY STOP available.
2. Planetary engines (fusion in magnetic cups, thrust limited by field pressure; reaction mass argon in air, iron above 30 km): numpad + / - main throttle, Ctrl + full, Ctrl - zero, * cut. Pods: GONDOLY lever and nozzle angle on ENGINES. Attitude numpad 2/8 4/6 1/3, / rotation/linear, 5 kill rotation. G-limiter on ENGINES.
3. Anamezon (interstellar drive): ENGINES - IGNITION (field - kaon beam - feed). Locked below ~50 km in an atmosphere (hot-start interlock) and near oxygen worlds and crews (radiation); the bypass needs two presses within 3 s. Use it only far from planets. G-compensator up to 200 g.
Damage: feet (12 petals each), legs and hull zones break on hard landings.
END_DESC

